      "created_at": "2014-01-07T21:36:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, because while you can only use a particular power once per turn, once it's someone else's turn that means it's now a <span class=\"bbcode-i\">different</span> turn so if they have the means to let you use a power, you can use the same one you just used on your own turn :).</p>",
