      "raw": "<p>Unlike Embolden Overdrive does not state you do it during the power phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is no inherent restriction on when you are allowed to do certain activities.</p><p>When Reset says to draw a card we don&#39;t wait until the draw phase, and no one questions Team leader letting you draw during the Power Phase or Adept letting you play a card during his power phase, but when powers get involved we start inventing restrictions.</p><p>The power phase is the point during your turn when you get a free power use. &nbsp;Just like the play phase and the draw phase.</p><p>Overdrive lets you use Strike twice during the current turn. &nbsp;That would fit anywhere between the start and end of turn.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
